   (10x15 portrait; page 4 is 15x10 landscape), including nested/한국어0016.png.
   Created with the official RAR 7.23 macOS ARM64 evaluation tool, 4 MiB dictionary,
   -s / -s- / -hpfixture-password. The tool itself is NOT distributed or required.
   Tool source: https://www.rarlab.com/rar/rarmacos-arm-723.tar.gz
   Downloaded package SHA256: 68b393c000758d477fde43c955ff7542f12f76f3f5e87cdda923152fc791bd4d
   These fixtures contain genuine PNG bytes, unlike the renamed upstream error fixtures.

 real-pages-rar4-store.rar
   Sixteen original PNGs in a minimal uncompressed RAR4 container, with standard
   file/data CRCs. Fixture bytes were authored for validation and independently
   accepted by 7-Zip 26.04. No archive-writing implementation exists in the product.
